«
@@ ============================================================
@@ ElmData — the record of a chemical element, for programs
@@ Input : the atomic number Z, the symbol ("Fe") or the name ("Iron")
@@ Output: { Z "Symbol" "Name" Ar° Abridged A Group Period "Family" "State"
@@           Tmelt Tboil Density Electronegativity Ionization "Configuration"
@@           "Isotope" Fraction "Most stable" IsotopeMass }
@@ Ar° is the standard atomic weight interval of the CIAAW (2024), Abridged the
@@ abridged value; "—" marks a missing value. The data are read from one of
@@ twelve small files, library/Chemistry/ElmD01.48s … ElmD12.48s.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ ============================================================
  → x
  «
    0
    IF x TypeName "text" == THEN
      "/library/Chemistry/ElmNames.48s" RCL Explode DROP
      → s n
      «
        1 118 FOR i
          IF s i GET x == n i GET x == OR THEN DROP i END
        NEXT
      »
    ELSE
      DROP x IP R→I
    END
    → z
    «
      IF z 1 < z 118 > OR THEN "ElmData: unknown element" DoError END
      z 1 - 10 / IP R→I 1 +
      → f
      «
        "/library/Chemistry/ElmD" IF f 10 < THEN "0" + END f →Text + ".48s" +
        RCL z 1 - 10 MOD 1 + GET
      »
    »
  »
»
